menu "BurnScope display"

choice BURNSCOPE_DISPLAY
    prompt "Display profile"
    default BURNSCOPE_DISPLAY_CYD2USB_ST7789
    help
        Picks one panel-driver-plus-UI bundle. Each profile lives under
        `main/displays/<name>/` and owns both its panel bring-up and its
        LVGL layout because UI design is geometry-bound. Add new screens
        by dropping in a sibling directory and a new option here.

    config BURNSCOPE_DISPLAY_CYD2USB_ST7789
        bool "Cheap Yellow Display (cyd2usb, ST7789 320x240 landscape)"

endchoice

endmenu
